     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hi,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">In order to get the correlation matrix\r\namong the latent variables from the output in a CFA, I performed the command “inspect(fit,\r\n&quot;<a href=\"http://cor.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cor.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792429736378000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GxhwH-h6_D32adIXD-bWg\">cor.lv</a>&quot;)&quot; and I got the result. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Also, I performed “inspect(fit,\r\n&quot;<a href=\"http://cov.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cov.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792429736378000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3J0K3xHonGtciPfE7MoF0d\">cov.lv</a>&quot;)&quot; command for comparing between the covariance and the correlation of </span> the latent variables.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">The results ( the covariance matrix and the\r\ncorrelation </span>matrix among the latent variables) are same. Is it correct?</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Carl</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
