   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "How have you set the metric of your latent variables? If you set the latent variance to 1.0 the covariance between latents becomes a correlation making the <a href=\"http://cov.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cov.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792429736378000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3J0K3xHonGtciPfE7MoF0d\">cov.lv</a> and <a href=\"http://cor.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cor.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792429736378000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GxhwH-h6_D32adIXD-bWg\">cor.lv</a> identical."
    ]
   ]
  },
